OL,3,GNEWSACar crashed into man's home with
OL,4,A'almighty bang'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who was at home when a car
OL,7,Fcrashed into his front room has said it
OL,8,Fis "amazing" that no lives were lost.
OL,10,FPhil Barnett, 80, was sitting
OL,11,Fdownstairs in the home he shares with
OL,12,Fhis wife in Canal View, Chirk Bank,
OL,13,FShropshire, when a car being pursued by
OL,14,FNorth Wales Police smashed into their
OL,15,Fproperty shortly before 22:00 GMT on
OL,16,FSaturday.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,358,350,200,160,0,100
