OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSACar crashed into man's home with
OL,4,A'almighty bang'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBarnett said: "There's this almighty
OL,7,Fbang, I thought something had fallen
OL,8,Fthrough the roof, one of my neighbours
OL,9,Flater said he thought something had
OL,10,Ffallen from a plane through the roof of
OL,11,Fthe house, which about sums it up.
OL,13,F"It's just amazing that he got out, I
OL,14,Fdidn't see a spot of blood anywhere.
OL,15,FThe fact that he's still alive, never
OL,16,Fmind us, is just amazing."
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
